cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this formalization and its accompanying paper when using this work."
type: software
title: "Nonfreeness for rational two-parabolic groups with numerator 24: Lean formalization"
version: "0.1.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/wingsyuyi-satori/nonfree-G24r"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Ziheng
    affiliation: "University of Chinese Academy of Sciences, Hangzhou Institute for Advanced Study, Hangzhou, China"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of nonfreeness for the groups generated by
  two standard unipotent matrices at parameter 24/r for every integer r with
  absolute value greater than six, with at most 64 generator-power syllables
  in a reduced relation and a two-step triangular word when |r| > 17.
  AI assistance: GPT-6-Astra. Software: MIT; accompanying paper: CC BY 4.0.
keywords:
  - Lean
  - formal verification
  - free groups
  - relation numbers
  - unipotent matrices
